    "min_awards": null,
    "max_awards": null,
    "plot": "It is 6:00 PM at the Miller household. At 7:00 PM sharp, Grandma Edith — the terrifying family matriarch with a clipboard for a soul — will ring the front doorbell. She expects three things: a piping hot Legendary Casserole, a peaceful and functional family, and the heirloom fine china set in the dining room. Currently, the kitchen is a disaster zone with a smoking microwave and Dad trying to fix the disposal with a ##BANANA. Grandpa Joe is blasting war documentaries in the living room because the remote is dead, Mom is having a corporate meltdown in the dining room while guarding the china cabinet, and Neighbor Kevin keeps sneaking in through the unlocked back door. Alex must navigate four rooms of domestic madness, solve the household puzzles, assemble a working remote, bake the casserole in the conventional ##OVEN, lock out Kevin, and set the table before time runs out.",
    "rules": "Combat is disabled (can_damage_npcs=false). All challenges are resolved through inventory puzzles, deterministic switches, container codes, and social interactions. The adventure tracks domestic preparedness via story flags in tw.vars.\n\nChapter 4 — Lockdown and Fine China (SEQ_4_LOCKDOWN_AND_FINE_CHINA): Begin this chapter when the preceding chapter is complete, regardless of the current values of kevin_locked_out and table_set. Kevin may still be inside and the table may still be unset: resolving these problems is the work of this chapter. Require both kevin_locked_out and table_set to be true only for chapter completion. This entry rule takes precedence over any conflicting entry guard.",
    "intro_text": "The grandfather clock in the front hallway chimes six times, each strike sounding like a ticking time bomb. You stand on the frayed welcome mat, clutching a hastily scribbled chore list. In exactly sixty minutes, Grandma Edith will materialize on the front porch with her white inspection gloves and an eagerness to rewrite her last will and testament.\n\nFrom down the hall, an acrid plume of grey smoke wafts out of the kitchen, accompanied by the rhythmic clanging of a ##WRENCH and your father muttering about 'hydro-bananadynamics.' To your left, the living room floor vibrates from the deafening roar of a television turned up to maximum volume. To your right, your mother's frantic corporate buzzwords echo from the dining room. You take a deep breath. Saving dinner starts right here in the hallway.",
    "completed_condition": "",
    "gameover_condition": "",
    "completed_guard_expression": "tw.vars.get('casserole_baked') == True and tw.vars.get('grandpa_pacified') == True and tw.vars.get('kevin_locked_out') == True and tw.vars.get('table_set') == True",
    "gameover_guard_expression": "tw.player.hp <= 0 or tw.vars.get('house_burned_down') == True",
